<title>USA: Tencor, Uniphase extend talks.</title>
<headline>Tencor, Uniphase extend talks.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tencor Instruments and Uniphase Corp said Tencor's acquisition of Uniphase unit Ultrapointe Corp  will not close before the end of December 1996, as originally anticipated.</p>
<p>Due to both companies' scheduled holiday breaks, due diligence was unable to be completed by year end.</p>
<p>Tencor and Uniphase said they both anticipate that they will resume negotiations following the holiday season with the mutual objective of completing this acquisition early in 1997.</p>
</text>
